SystemModel + SystemAgent = Director / OS brain

Owns system health, modes, boot/recovery, experiments.

Runs mostly in background, but can also answer direct system questions.

OrchestrationModel + OrchestrationAgent = Manager / conductor

Owns user-facing workflows and multi-agent coordination.

Delegates to HCO agents, tools, domains.

Reports important system issues or completion summaries back to SystemAgent.

HCO Agents = Head office workers

